      },
      "text": "```\nHomogeneous Transform (4x4):"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-KINEMATICS.md#009",
      "path": [
        "01-KINEMATICS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:robotics:01-kinematics, git-history:robotics:01-kinematics]",
        "canonical_path": "robotics/01-KINEMATICS.md",
        "concepts": "[kinematics]",
        "current_path": "robotics/01-KINEMATICS.md",
        "id": "maxim:robotics:kinematics",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "robotics",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[kinematics]",
        "section": "robotics",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Robotics - Kinematics",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "T = | R  p |     R: 3x3 rotation matrix (SO(3))\n       | 0  1 |     p: 3x1 translation vector\n                    0: 1x3 zero row\n                    1: scalar 1"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-KINEMATICS.md#010",
      "path": [
        "01-KINEMATICS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:robotics:01-kinematics, git-history:robotics:01-kinematics]",
        "canonical_path": "robotics/01-KINEMATICS.md",
        "concepts": "[kinematics]",
        "current_path": "robotics/01-KINEMATICS.md",
        "id": "maxim:robotics:kinematics",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "robotics",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[kinematics]",
        "section": "robotics",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Robotics - Kinematics",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Represents: \"frame B's origin is at p, and its axes are rotated by R,\n                all expressed in frame A.\""
    },
    {
      "id": "01-KINEMATICS.md#011",
      "path": [
        "01-KINEMATICS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:robotics:01-kinematics, git-history:robotics:01-kinematics]",
        "canonical_path": "robotics/01-KINEMATICS.md",
        "concepts": "[kinematics]",
        "current_path": "robotics/01-KINEMATICS.md",
        "id": "maxim:robotics:kinematics",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
