        "section": "robotics",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Robotics - Kinematics",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Composition: T_AC = T_AB * T_BC\n                \"A to C\" = \"A to B\" * \"B to C\"\n                (matrix multiply — this is the FK chain)\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-KINEMATICS.md#012",
      "path": [
        "01-KINEMATICS.md"
